&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the job is only available from the locations outlined.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
