&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Strategic Sourcing Manager (all genders) to help shape and scale our Procurement function in Berlin. You will establish and implement strategic procurement processes, build the first material group strategies and drive their end-to-end implementation. You will prepare and lead contract negotiations and contribute to the professionalisation and digitisation of Procurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Material Groups in Scope:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timber / CLT (cross-laminated timber) and related engineered wood products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steel (structural steel, connectors, fasteners, profiles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows / Façade systems (glazing, frames, façade elements, seals)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEP (Mechanical, Electrical, Plumbing) including HVAC, electrical components, piping and sub-assemblies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;1) Build strategic procurement foundations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and implement strategic procurement processes (e.g., sourcing methodology, governance, templates, KPIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the first material group strategies (category roadmaps, supplier landscape, TCO logic, risk and sustainability criteria) and drive implementation across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape supplier segmentation and SRM routines (performance reviews, development plans, risk mitigation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure cross-functional alignment with Engineering, Production, Quality and Project teams to translate requirements into scalable sourcing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;2) Lead sourcing &amp;amp; negotiations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own supplier discovery, RFx, benchmarking and award decisions for construction-material categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and execute commercial and contractual negotiations (pricing, frameworks, terms &amp;amp; conditions) in collaboration with Legal/Finance and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive supplier qualification and continuous improvement with a focus on availability, quality, lead times, and total cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across Europe and proactively manage supply risks (capacity, market volatility, compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;3) Enable procurement professionalisation &amp;amp; digitisation (pick your impact lane)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your strengths, you will own workstreams in one of the following areas to make Procurement scalable, transparent and data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and roll out scalable end-to-end processes (Source-to-Contract / Procure-to-Pay).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define roles, approvals and standards; develop playbooks and templates (RFx, negotiation, contract standards).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build spend and category transparency; define a KPI framework (savings, supplier performance, delivery reliability, risk).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create decision-ready dashboards and routines for performance and savings tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify automation opportunities (workflows, approvals, master data, reporting) and drive implementation with tool owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve data quality and process compliance through smart tooling and standardisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Change Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create change narratives, communication plans and training formats to ensure adoption of new processes and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate workshops and enable stakeholders to work effectively with the new procurement set-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;5-7 years of experience in procurement consulting OR 7-10 years of professional expertise in strategic sourcing setting up and implementing material group and dual-sourcing strategies&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;with measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation and contracting skills; structured, ownership-driven working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset (TCO, supplier performance, risk) and ability to translate insights into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator, strong stakeholder management, and a collaborative approach in cross-functional set-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both English and German (min. B2 level)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP/procurement systems (e.g., SAP S/4HANA) and data-driven procurement routines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of construction-material markets and supplier landscapes (timber/CLT, steel, windows/façade, MEP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How To Apply:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Send us your CV and, if you like, a short note highlighting: (1) the categories/material groups you’ve owned, (2) negotiation and contracting experience, (3) examples of process build-up and/or digital procurement initiatives, and (4) your preferred impact lane (Process / Analytics / Automation / Change).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be part of something big:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You’re here to make a change? Come on board. At GROPYUS, we are on a mission to re-think an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;It’s on you:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;We offer a tremendous amount of ownership and room to make a mark - at all our organization levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Focus on results:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You choose if you work from home, a park, or the office. Whether you start your day early, after your run, or pick up on work when your kids are in bed. What counts is your contribution and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring your uniqueness to the team&lt;/em&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Innovation requires diversity of thought. Diversity in background, experience and thinking is crucial to create the best product for everyone. We actively seek diversity and strive to unlock each other’s full potential. We are very proud that people from all industries and all walks of life are joining our company – in addition to core areas such as construction, engineering, and start-ups, from stock-listed companies from across automotive e-Commerce, digital, sporting goods, and more. You will work in international teams with passionate colleagues. Inspire and be inspired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be an owner:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Participate in the success of GROPYUS through stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of a highly collaborative product team working at the core of our manufacturing facility, transforming digital models into physical elements at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Teams at GROPYUS own what they build, including underlying infrastructure, build pipelines, automated testing, release and rollout management, monitoring, and support. You will bring your experience in working with PLCs and/or other OT systems like e.g. robots, into the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will help evolve manufacturing systems from vendor-driven PLC and robot logic toward a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;modern, software-defined architecture. A central part of the role is to understand existing control logic, abstract it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;into maintainable software components, and gradually migrate relevant functionality into&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;Python-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot;&gt;simulation-ready systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW232776509 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, our teams are also responsible for operating and troubleshooting the software they have developed during working hours of the factory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer (f/m/d) on the Product Delivery team, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Analyze and explain existing PLC&amp;nbsp;(Siemens TIA Portal), robot&amp;nbsp;(KUKA KRL), and OT code from external vendors, and help translate that knowledge&amp;nbsp;into shared engineering understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design and implement&amp;nbsp;Python-based&amp;nbsp;software components that replace, abstract, or orchestrate legacy PLC&amp;nbsp;and robot logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build maintainable, testable, and well-structured services with a strong focus on code quality, modularity,&amp;nbsp;and long-term ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing an &lt;strong&gt;operational mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to monitor, maintain, and improve software uptime including reliable updates, latency, and efficiency&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a bridge between digital product delivery &amp;amp; physical logistics and manufacturing systems, ensuring both are aligned and integrated&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping define, monitor and evolve&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SLAs/SLOs&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;as well as other important KPIs like e.g. OEE for critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are an experienced software engineer with&amp;nbsp;very good&amp;nbsp;coding skills in Python or another modern object-oriented programming language such as C++ or C#.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You have a solid understanding of software design, abstraction, modularity, and maintainable system architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You have experience writing clean, testable, production-grade code and applying modern software engineering practices such as code reviews, automated testing, and CI/CD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are confident working in operationally critical environments where reliability, observability, and controlled change management matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&amp;nbsp;have the ability to&amp;nbsp;understand and gradually modernize legacy systems without losing business continuity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&amp;nbsp;are able to&amp;nbsp;communicate effectively across software, manufacturing, and operations domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You have experience with PLC programming, industrial robots, or OT systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are familiar with KUKA KRL, OPC-UA, MQTT, or similar industrial integration technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You have worked in&amp;nbsp;logistics, manufacturing, or other production-critical environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are familiar with simulation-driven development or digital twins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;unlimited&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;contract with 30 vacation days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible, hybrid work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You can work from home or come into the office on the schedule that works best for you. Feel like traveling and working from another location? No problem. Tune into meetings and work from abroad for up to 40 days per year. In addition, flex hours allow you to prioritize important moments in your day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Attractive perks and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We offer a company pension scheme, language courses (English/German), and employee discounts with selected sustainable brands. Furthermore, our external partners in mental health support you in strengthening your mental health through anonymous private/group sessions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Virtual Shares Program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Participate in the success of GROPYUS through our Virtual Share Program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: You can truly make your mark with your work and contributions – on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;all our organizational levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The chance to be part of something big&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Our mission is to rethink an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and fostering sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A diverse and enriching work environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Become a valued member of a wonderfully diverse team of individuals from over 50 countries. At GROPYUS we value inclusion above all, ensuring that everyone feels they belong – no matter their background. In this way, our differences become strengths that help us grow as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In dieser Rolle arbeitest du aktiv an der Weiterentwicklung und Standardisierung von operativen Prozessen rund um Planung, Vergabe und Bauausführung im Bereich Systembau und Generalübernehmung. Dein Fokus liegt auf den entscheidenden Übergangsphasen zwischen Planung und Ausführung, insbesondere den Stage Gates SG4 (Ausführungsplanung abgeschlossen) und SG5 (Vergaben &amp;amp; Freeze).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemeinsam mit Planung, Arbeitsvorbereitung und Projektteams stellst du sicher, dass Projekte mit der notwendigen technischen und organisatorischen Reife in die Bauausführung übergehen. Dabei trägst du dazu bei, Rework, Nachträge und ineffiziente Abläufe nachhaltig zu reduzieren, indem du bestehende Prozesse analysierst, Verbesserungspotenziale identifizierst und bei der Umsetzung praxistauglicher Standards unterstützt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du arbeitest eng mit operativen Teams zusammen und bist regelmäßig nah am Projektgeschehen, um reale Herausforderungen zu verstehen und Lösungen praxisnah mitzugestalten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse und Weiterentwicklung von Prozessen in den Phasen Ausführungsplanung, Vergabe, Freeze und Übergang in die Bauausführung (SG4–SG5)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitwirkung bei der Definition und Implementierung klarer Reife-, Freeze- und Übergabekriterien für eine stabile Bauausführung&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Planung, Arbeitsvorbereitung und Project Steering zur frühzeitigen Sicherstellung der Ausführungsreife&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auswertung von Nacharbeiten, Nachträgen und Verzögerungen sowie Ableitung konkreter Verbesserungsmaßnahmen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitarbeit bei der Entwicklung und Einführung standardisierter Prozesse und Best Practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begleitung ausgewählter Projekte bzw. Baustellen zur Validierung und kontinuierlichen Verbesserung von Prozessen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der Etablierung und Einhaltung von Prozessstandards im Sinne von Operational Excellence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliche Optimierung bestehender Prozesse entlang eines strukturierten Verbesserungsansatzes (z. B. PDCA)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Über dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Studium im Bauingenieurwesen, Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen, Projektmanagement oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 Jahre Berufserfahrung in Bauausführung, Arbeitsvorbereitung, Projektmanagement oder vergleichbaren Funktionen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gutes Verständnis für Ausführungsplanung, Vergaben und Bauabläufe sowie deren Wechselwirkungen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Analyse, Optimierung oder Standardisierung von Prozessen im Bauumfeld&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Praxisorientierte Denkweise und Interesse daran, Prozesse im realen Projektumfeld zu verbessern&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kommunikationsstärke und Fähigkeit, mit unterschiedlichen Stakeholdern konstruktiv zusammenzuarbeiten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturierte und lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise mit Fokus auf Qualität und Umsetzbarkeit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft zu gelegentlichen Baustellenbesuchen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und gute Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Über uns&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein unbefristeter Vertrag mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsweise: Wir legen großen Wert auf regelmäßige persönliche Zusammenarbeit im Büro, und bieten auch die Möglichkeit zum Arbeiten im Homeoffice sowie die Option, bis zu 40 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtuelles Aktienprogramm: Profitiere von GROPYUS Erfolg durch unser Virtuelles Aktienprogramm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigenverantwortung: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

